    <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Proposed test with existing data: For a specified class 4 rule catalog, enumerate persistent structures and classify them by internal-state complexity and displacement per period. Test whether every rule above a preregistered persistent-structure complexity threshold contains a nonzero-velocity structure.";
